UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>Master the essentials of finance, banking, investment, and analysis with our revamped Master of Finance. Aligned with the CFA Institute and a CAIA Academic Partner, the program covers FinTech, AI, blockchain, cybersecurity, alternative investments, business analytics, and sustainability. Gain hands-on experience through two industry-led capstone projects in Finance and FinTech.</p> <p> <a href="/course/postgraduate/master-of-finance/handbook"> Check the Master of Finance handbook </a> </p> <p> <a href="/courses/find-a-course/download-course-guide"> Get a copy of our course guide </a> </p> <h5> Swinburne Open Day 2026 </h5> <p>Registrations are now open. Get on your way with tours, info sessions, hands-on activities and more on Sunday 26 July.</p> <p> <a href="https://www.swinburne.edu.au/openday/?siid=bnr_alt%7Ccamp_opd%7Csrcnam_cs%7Csrcloc_alt%7C466"> Register now </a> </p> <h5>Upgrade your skills</h5> <ul><li> Problem-Solving </li> <li> Analytical thinking </li> <li> Critical Thinking </li> <li> Digital literacy </li> <li> Leadership </li> <li> Communication </li> </ul> <h5>Stretch your career further</h5> <p>Students can enhance their career opportunities by gaining additional leadership and management skills – an important asset in a today’s complex and changing business environment. The below examples demonstrate the types of roles graduates can attain.</p> <ul><li> Fintech Business Analyst </li> <li> AI-Driven Financial Analyst </li> <li> ESG Investment Analyst </li> <li> Alternative Investment Analyst </li> <li> Digital Asset Manager </li> <li> Cybersecurity Specialist in Finance </li> </ul> <h5>Key codes</h5> <p> CRICOS course code </p> <p> 102233A </p> <h5> International student visa </h5> <p>International students in Australia who hold student visas are required to study full-time and on campus. Courses that are taught entirely online are only available to international students studying outside Australia or those in Australia who are not on a student visa. Online courses are not available to international students in Australia who hold a student visa.</p> <h5>Strong industry connections and co-creation</h5> <p>Swinburne''s CFA-affiliated Master of Finance covers 70% of the CFA Program CBOK while integrating CAIA content and emphasizing ethics. As FINSIA''s first Australian university partner, students receive complimentary membership with exclusive resources and mentorship. These prestigious affiliations offer exam scholarships and equip graduates with technical expertise, ethical foundations, and professional networks essential for financial industry success.</p> <p> <a href="/life-at-swinburne/work-integrated-learning"> Explore Work Integrated Learning </a> </p> <h5>Professional accreditations</h5> <ul><li> <a href="https://www.aacsb.edu/"> <h5> AACSB Accredited </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.cfainstitute.org/"> <h5> CFA Institute </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://caia.org/"> <h5> CAIA </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.cfainstitute.org/programs/sustainable-investing-certificate"> <h5> CFA Sustainable Investing </h5> </a> </li> </ul> <h5>Industry partners</h5> <ul><li> <a href="https://finsia.com/"> <h5> Finsia </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://williambuck.com/"> <h5> William Buck </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://lensellgroup.com/"> <h5> Lensell </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://banxa.com/"> <h5> Banxa </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.biocareprojects.com/"> <h5> BIOcare </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.exequantum.com/"> <h5> ExeQuantum </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.fticonsulting.com/australia"> <h5> FTI Consulting </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.gbbc.io/"> <h5> GBBC </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.inaam.me/"> <h5> inaam </h5> </a> </li> </ul> <h5>Technology partners</h5> <ul><li> <a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/asia"> <h5> Bloomberg </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.northinfo.com/"> <h5> Northfield </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.adobe.com/express/"> <h5> Adobe </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.python.org/"> <h5> Python </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.cmegroup.com/"> <h5> CME Group </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.microsoft365.com/"> <h5> Microsoft 365 </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/power-platform/products/power-bi"> <h5> Microsoft Power BI </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://openai.com/"> <h5> OpenAI </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.plus500.com/en-au/"> <h5> Plus500 </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.microsoft.com/en-au/sql-server/sql-server-downloads"> <h5> SQL </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.tableau.com/trial/tableau-cloud?d=7013y000002SPF8AAO&amp;nc=7013y0000020d5HAAQ&amp;utm_source=tableau&amp;utm_medium=paid_search&amp;utm_campaign=apac_au_tabcon&amp;utm_content=_tableau-cloud_7013y000002SPF8AAO&amp;utm_term=tableau&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gclid=EAIaIQobChMIlYL06afviwMVwaNmAh32ODEFEAAYASAAEgLHmfD_BwE&amp;gclsrc=aw.ds"> <h5> Tableau </h5> </a> </li> </ul> <h5>Why Swinburne?</h5> <p>Top 5% of the world’s higher education business schools</p> <p>91.1% of graduates found employment within 4 months of finishing.</p> <p>The median income for PG graduates one year out is $79.5K</p> <p>Business graduate employers include Telstra, NAB, ANZ and IBM</p> <p> <a href="/about/our-university/rankings-ratings">Source</a> </p> <p> <a href="#"> Close video </a> </p> <p>Where Innovation Meets Finance (Swinburne Master of Finance)</p> <h5>Where Innovation Meets Finance (Swinburne Master of Finance)</h5> <p><b>[0:01 — 0:04]</b></p> <p><i>(A nighttime aerial view of Melbourne’s CBD shows the city bustling below as a time-lapse moves through to sunrise.)</i></p> <p><b>[0:04 — 00:08]</b></p> <p><i>(Text appears on the screen that reads “Where innovation meets finance” as the camera zooms into the part of the city where Swinburne’s Hawthorn campus is located. The Swinburne logo with “School of Business, Law and Entrepreneurship appears above the logo as the camera zooms further into campus.)</i></p> <p><b>[00:08 — 00:13]</b></p> <p><i>(Cut to Associate Professor Reza Tajaddini. His name is displayed over text reading “Chair, Department of Accounting, Economics and Finance”)</i></p> <p>Reza: Swinburne Master of Finance is a unique program</p> <p>designed with the collaboration of industry</p> <p><b>[00:13 — 00:22]</b></p> <p><i>(Cut to hands type on a laptop keyboard visualisations of data, binary code and pie charts, appear over the footage.)</i></p> <p>Reza VO: and it also introduces you to the cutting-edge topics in fintech,</p> <p>blockchain, cybersecurity, artificial intelligence</p> <p><b>[00:22 — 00:25]</b></p> <p>and financial crime that, at the moment,</p> <p>you cannot find anywhere else.</p> <p><b>[00:25 — 00:28]</b></p> <p><i>(Cut to Dr Jason Tian. His name is displayed over text reading “Course Director Master of Finance”)</i></p> <p>Jason: Our program really connects you with the industry</p> <p><b>[00:28 — 00:32]</b></p> <p><i>(CFA, CAIA and FINSIA logos appear over footage in turn.)</i></p> <p>Our strong partnership with the CFA,</p> <p>as well as unique partnerships with CAIA as well as FINSIA means</p> <p><b>[00:38 — 00:44]</b></p> <p>that you are not just getting a degree,</p> <p>but also getting yourself ready for recognised</p> <p>and impactful finance careers in the future.</p> <p><b>[00:44 — 00:48]</b></p> <p><i>(Cut to Iengchuo Tang. His name is displayed over text reading “Master of Finance alum”)</i></p> <p><i>Iengchuo: </i>Here at Swinburne, technology was a big part of the learning</p> <p><b>[00:48 — 00:54]</b></p> <p><i>(Python, R, Power BI and Xero logos appear over footage in turn.)</i></p> <p>I got to explore a lot of tools such as</p> <p>Python, R, Power BI and also Xero</p> <p><b>[00:54 — 01:03]</b></p> <p>These tools allowed me to build confidence in handling data,</p> <p>Both during my time at Total Energy and also currently in my PhD Project.</p> <p><b>[01:03 — 01:07]</b></p> <p><i>(Cut to Jason Tian teaching a class in Swinburne’s Bloomberg Trading Lab)</i></p> <p>Reza VO: Our investment units are offered in a Bloomberg Trading Lab, which enables</p> <p><b>[01:07 — 01:13]</b></p> <p>students to work with Bloomberg Terminal</p> <p>on live data, learning new skills highly demanded by industry.</p> <p><b>[01:13 — 01:20]</b></p> <p><i>(Cut to Hazel Le. Her name is displayed over text reading “Bachelor of Business (Finance) alum”)</i></p> <p>Hazel: During my time at Swinburne, I had a wonderful opportunity</p> <p>to participate in the Bloomberg Trading Challenge.</p> <p><b>[01:20 — 01:29]</b></p> <p>I had a chance to be the team leader and had an opportunity to apply</p> <p>all the knowledge learned in a classroom into a practical</p> <p><b>[01:29 — 01:37]</b></p> <p>and real-world experience, using the cutting-edge technology</p> <p>that Swinburne offered through the Bloomberg Terminal.</p> <p><b>[01:37 — 01:43]</b></p> <p><i>(Cut to Associate Professor Dimitrios Salampasis. His name is displayed over text reading “Associate Professor, Emerging Technologies and FinTech”)</i></p> <p>Dimitrios<i>: </i>Financial technologies bring a fascinating new page</p> <p>in the way we understand financial services and finance in general.</p> <p><b>[01:43 — 01:55]</b></p> <p><i>(Cut to close-up of students working at the Terminals in the Bloomberg Trading lab. They point and discuss as they study and interpret stock data.)</i></p> <p>Dimitrios VO<i>: </i>Units such as the Frontiers in Fintech, the Innovative Finance 2.0</p> <p>and the Applied Fintech Project will allow you all to immerse yourself</p> <p>into the fascinating world of fintech.</p> <p><b>[01:55 — 02:00]</b></p> <p>All of these are part of an amazing, industry co-created curriculum</p> <p>that allows you to be relevant, recent,</p> <p><b>[02:00 — 02:07]</b></p> <p><i>(Cut back to aerial shot of the CBD, now the sun is setting as the city.)</i></p> <p>but also craft your learning experience in terms of creating a</p> <p>unique talent for the future.</p> <p><b>[02:07 — 02:14]</b></p> <p><i>(Swinburne logo.)</i></p> <p>[END OF TRANSCRIPT]</p>',
    course_duration_per_week = 104,
