UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>The Associate Degree of Applied Artificial Intelligence equips you with the knowledge to apply artificial intelligence within cyber security or game development industries.</p> <p>Gain insight and knowledge into generative AI, prompt engineering and how to apply the outputs to generate value in products or within the maintenance of secure systems.</p> <p>With industry immersed projects, you will be equipped with practical skills, knowledge and a strong sense of ethical usage of AI within industries, preparing you to become experts in your field. </p> <p> <a href="/course/undergraduate/associate-degree-of-applied-artificial-intelligence/handbook"> Check the Associate Degree of Applied Artificial Intelligence handbook </a> </p> <p> <a href="/courses/find-a-course/download-course-guide"> Get a copy of our course guide </a> </p> <h5> August intake </h5> <p>The August 2026 intake for this course is currently limited to domestic students. This intake will only be delivering the Cyber Security and Cloud Computing major. </p> <p>If you''d like to know more <a href="https://www.swinburne.edu.au/contact-us/">get in touch with us today.</a></p> <h5> Swinburne Open Day 2026 </h5> <p>Stop by our Hawthorn campus on Sunday 26 July for Open Day – the stop where everything starts. Got everything you need? <a href="https://www.swinburne.edu.au/courses/intakes/mid-year/">Apply for midyear now and get on your way in Semester 2</a>.</p> <p> <a href="https://www.swinburne.edu.au/openday/?siid=bnr_alt%7Ccamp_mid%7Csrcnam_cs%7Csrcloc_alt%7C454"> Register for Open Day </a> </p> <h5>Skills you’ll learn</h5> <ul><li> AI prompt engineering </li> <li> Game design with AI </li> <li> Cyber threat mitigation with AI </li> <li> Art conceptualisation with AI </li> <li> Ethical and responsible AI practices </li> <li> AI model development and deployment </li> </ul> <h5>Your career opportunities</h5> <ul><li> Game designer </li> <li> AI concept artist </li> <li> AI visual effects artist </li> <li> Machine learning engineer </li> <li> AI security analyst </li> <li> AI product manager </li> </ul> <h5>Further education</h5> <ul><li> <a href="/course/undergraduate/bachelor-of-cyber-security"> Bachelor of Cyber Security </a> </li> <li> <a href="/course/undergraduate/bachelor-of-games-and-interactivity"> Bachelor of Games and Interactivity </a> </li> </ul> <h5>Industry partners</h5> <p>This course has been co-developed with global industry partners to integrate their technologies within the curriculum. Examinations and certifications may be attempted through these partners where applicable.</p> <ul><li> <a href="https://aws.amazon.com/"> <h5> Amazon Web Services </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.checkpoint.com/"> <h5> Check Point </h5> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.microsoft.com/en-au/ai"> <h5> Microsoft </h5> </a> </li> </ul>',
