UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>If a career that champions good health for all people is something you aspire to, expand your options and focus on the future with the Bachelor of Health Science/Bachelor of Applied Innovation double degree.</p> <p> <a href="/course/undergraduate/bachelor-of-health-science-bachelor-of-applied-innovation/handbook"> View Bachelor of Health Science / Bachelor of Applied Innovation handbook </a> </p> <h5> Swinburne Open Day 2026 </h5> <p>Stop by our Hawthorn campus on Sunday 26 July for Open Day – the stop where everything starts. Got everything you need? <a href="https://www.swinburne.edu.au/courses/intakes/mid-year/">Apply for midyear now and get on your way in Semester 2</a>.</p> <p> <a href="https://www.swinburne.edu.au/openday/?siid=bnr_alt%7Ccamp_mid%7Csrcnam_cs%7Csrcloc_alt%7C454"> Register for Open Day </a> </p> <h5>Your industry experience</h5> <p>Bolster your CV with real industry experience while you study through our Work Integrated Learning programs – a guaranteed part of all our bachelor degrees. </p> <p> <a href="/life-at-swinburne/work-integrated-learning"> Explore Work Integrated Learning </a> </p> <h5>Skills you’ll learn</h5> <ul><li> Health science communication </li> <li> Research skills </li> <li> Initiation skills </li> <li> Analytical-decision making </li> <li> Critical thinking </li> <li> Creative problem-solving </li> </ul> <h5>Your career opportunities</h5> <ul><li> Health policy developer </li> <li> Healthcare consultant </li> <li> Health communications officer </li> <li> Innovation consultant </li> <li> Human-centered researcher </li> <li> Innovation manager </li> </ul> <h5>Key codes</h5> <p> CRICOS course code </p> <p> 108356H </p> <p> VTAC Code (IFP) </p> <p> 3400212593 </p> <h5> International student visa </h5> <p>International students in Australia who hold student visas are required to study full-time and on campus. Courses that are taught entirely online are only available to international students studying outside Australia or those in Australia who are not on a student visa. Online courses are not available to international students in Australia who hold a student visa.</p> <h5>Why Swinburne?</h5> <p>Ranked Top 500 in Public Health</p> <p>ARWU Global Ranking of Academic Subjects 2022</p> <p>Ranked Top 300 in Nursing</p> ARWU Global Ranking of Academic Subjects 2022 <p>The only uni in Australia to have both MRI and MEG at a single site</p> <p>Ranked Top 250 in Psychology</p> Times Higher Education World University Ranking by Subject 2023 <p><a href="/life-at-swinburne/why-choose-swinburne/sources">Sources</a></p>',
