full-time </p> <p> <a href="https://www.swinburne.edu.au/study/course/Swinburne-Foundation-Program-(8-months)-SF-SFP/international"> Find out more (Swinburne Foundation Program) </a> </p> </li> </ul>',
    apply_form = 'https://www.swinburne.edu.au/course/degree-pathway/diploma-of-arts-and-communication-unilink-dp-artcom/?student_type=international',
