UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>Information and communication technology – or ICT – is at the forefront of the ongoing digital revolution. Our Bachelor of Information and Communication Technology/ Bachelor of Applied Innovation allows you to combine ICT with innovation to effect meaningful change in the ICT field.</p> <p>The Bachelor of Applied Innovation will develop your collaboration, creativity, and complex problem-solving skills in real-world contexts and leads to a final year semester project and an optional industry-based learning year. </p> <p> <a href="/course/undergraduate/bachelor-of-information-and-communication-technology-bachelor-of-applied-innovation/handbook"> View Bachelor of Information and Communication Technology / Bachelor of Applied Innovation course handbook </a> </p> <p> <a href="/courses/find-a-course/download-course-guide"> Get a copy of our course guide </a> </p> <h5> Swinburne Open Day 2026 </h5> <p>Stop by our Hawthorn campus on Sunday 26 July for Open Day – the stop where everything starts. Got everything you need? <a href="https://www.swinburne.edu.au/courses/intakes/mid-year/">Apply for midyear now and get on your way in Semester 2</a>.</p> <p> <a href="https://www.swinburne.edu.au/openday/?siid=bnr_alt%7Ccamp_mid%7Csrcnam_cs%7Csrcloc_alt%7C454"> Register for Open Day </a> </p> <h5>Your major</h5> <ul><li> <a href="/course/undergraduate/bachelor-of-information-and-communication-technology---bachelor-of-applied-innovation/network-technology"> Network Technology </a> </li> <li> <a href="/course/undergraduate/bachelor-of-information-and-communication-technology---bachelor-of-applied-innovation/software-technology"> Software Technology </a> </li> </ul> <h5>Your industry experience</h5> <p>Build up your CV with real industry experience while you study through our Work Integrated Learning programs, which are a guaranteed part of all our bachelor degrees and can include placements, internships or industry-linked projects. In this degree, you''ll apply your learning in six professionally focused, industry-linked projects.</p> <p> <a href="/life-at-swinburne/work-integrated-learning"> Explore Work Integrated Learning </a> </p> <h5>Skills you’ll learn</h5> <ul><li> Web programming </li> <li> App programming </li> <li> Server configuration </li> <li> Critical thinking </li> <li> Creative problem-solving </li> <li> Adaptability </li> </ul> <h5>Your career opportunities</h5> <ul><li> Innovation consultant </li> <li> Strategic designer </li> <li> Transformation lead </li> <li> Security and risk consultant </li> <li> Network or systems administrator </li> <li> Full stack software developer </li> </ul> <h5>Key codes</h5> <p> CRICOS course code </p> <p> 108357G </p> <p> VTAC Code (IFP) </p> <p> 3400212603 </p> <h5> International student visa </h5> <p>International students in Australia who hold student visas are required to study full-time and on campus. Courses that are taught entirely online are only available to international students studying outside Australia or those in Australia who are not on a student visa. Online courses are not available to international students in Australia who hold a student visa.</p> <h5>Professional accreditations</h5> <ul><li> <a href="https://www.acs.org.au"> <h5> Australian Computer Society </h5> </a> </li> </ul> <h5>Why Swinburne?</h5> <p>#1 in Australia for Computer Science and Engineering</p> <p>ARWU Global Ranking of Academic Subjects 2025</p> <p>#6 in Australia for Artificial Intelligence</p> US News: Best Global Universities <p>#1 in Victoria for Graduate Employability and Salary</p> QILT Graduate Outcomes Survey (GOS) 2024 <p>Top 150 Best Global Universities</p> <p>US News: Best Global University Rankings 2025-2026</p> <p><a href="/life-at-swinburne/why-choose-swinburne/sources">Sources</a></p>',
